<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Lehman ups Volkswagen target. [CORRECTED 10:59 GMT]</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Lehman ups Volkswagen target. [CORRECTED 10:59 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said on Friday it had raised its earnings per share estimates and its share price target for Volkswagen AG in the wake of Thursday's 1996 results and analysts meeting.</p>
<p>Analyst Chris Will at the investment bank said he had upped his price target on Volkswagen shares to 1,250 marks from 1,000 marks and his 1997 earnings per share estimate to 70 marks from 50.</p>
<p>Will raised his 1998 estimate to 100 (corrects figure from 110)  marks from 80 and his 1999 estimate to 140 marks from 120.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
